#NEXUS

[ zhang2022a_fig16: Mamenchisaurid summary tree, read by eye. Polytomies: Omeisaurus maoianus, Haute Mouloya taxon and the rest; and the 15-branch crown from Xinjiangtitan to Mamenchisaurus constructus. The black dot marks the node joining Tienshanosaurus to the rest and is not encoded; no clade names are printed. 24 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 15 children). Sample 9 case (census 3, seed 20261272). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=24;
    TAXLABELS
        Shunosaurus
        Omeisaurus_maoianus
        Haute_Mouloya_taxon
        Cetiosaurus_oxoniensis
        Cetiosauriscus_stewarti
        Omeisaurus_tianfuensis
